            "review_title": "Review at Hong Ngoc Restaurant - Vietnamese Cuisine",
            "review_text": "M.w. Addison\nIstanbul, Türkiye87 contributions\n0\nThe Taste of Vietnam in One Place\nDec 2019\nLocated the French Quarter, this smart restaurant has dishes from all over Vietnam from Banh Xeo in the South to Pho of Hanoi. The food is tasty and presented well. The staff show yuo the proper way to prepare and eat each dish. It is relatively inexpensive. All in one place and my standard for lunch most days.\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten January 20, 2020",
